  "description": "Details required by conditions 17(i) (Tree re-planting plan) and 36 (Biodiversity Gain Plan) of permission 24/00805/FUL (Demolition of existing buildings, redevelopment to provide 34 unit co-living accommodation in a three storey building with basement; ancillary landscaping, cycle provision, refuse storage, disabled car parking)",
  "development_type": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "In the absence of a 30-year Habitat Management and Monitoring Plan (HMMP), and insufficient information to demonstrate the delivery, monitoring and long-term maintenance of biodiversity net gain, together with the absence of detailed ecological mitigation measures including lighting strategy, species protection measures and habitat management provisions, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the development would secure measurable and lasting biodiversity enhancements.\r\rThe proposal therefore fails to comply with Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, the Environment Act 2021, Paragraphs 187 and 193 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy G6 of the London Plan, and Policies CS3 and DM6 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012)."
  ],
